# Scene alpha-edge (test/README.md): hldemo2's '{' fence textures (palette
# index 255 transparent, CI4 TLUT slot 0 with alpha 0, world-surfaces.md)
# seen close up for colour fringes at their alpha edges: the window of the
# shotgun room's door #659 (func_door *167, {fence2, x 8..72, y 164..172,
# window centre z 235; uplink.route walks into it after the vent drop), then
# the east walkway railing func_illusionary #230 (*60, {rail2, x 1984..2176,
# y 272..274, z 160..192; uplink.route's crane-button stop 2135 310). Shots
# are the check (no route window: the poses are not on the route's path).
startmap hldemo2
waitmap hldemo2 60
god 1
stats begin
# shotgun room, facing south at the door's fence window
setpos 40 214 196 -8 270
wait 0.5
shot door-near
wait 0.1
setpos 28 250 196 -4 280
wait 0.5
shot door-far
wait 0.1
# east walkway, looking down south-west at the railing and the warehouse past it
setpos 2100 312 196 35 260
wait 0.5
shot rail-near
wait 0.1
setpos 2060 360 196 20 280
wait 0.5
shot rail-far
wait 0.1
stats end
wait 0.2
pass
